   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>Aşağıda üç farklı durum ve kuvvetin (F) değişen bir niceliğe (x) göre değişimini gösteren dört grafik verilmiştir. Bütün durumlarda sürtünmeler ve makine ağırlıkları önemsiz, yük her zaman aynıdır.</p>\n<div class=\"box\"><b>a)</b> Eşit bölmeli bir kaldıraçta destek ve kuvvetin uygulandığı nokta sabitken yük destekten uzaklaştırılıyor (x: yük kolu).<br>\n<b>b)</b> Yüksekliği sabit tutulan bir eğik düzlemin uzunluğu artırılıyor (x: eğik düzlemin uzunluğu).<br>\n<b>c)</b> Eğimi (yerle yaptığı açı) sabit tutulan bir eğik düzlemin uzunluğu artırılıyor (x: eğik düzlemin uzunluğu).</div>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 150\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Dört kuvvet grafiği I, II, III, IV\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\n<line x1=\"22\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"122\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"122\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"114\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"72.0\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">I</text><line x1=\"162\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"162\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"162\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text><polyline points=\"170.0,35.0 172.2,47.5 174.4,56.4 176.6,63.1 178.8,68.3 181.0,72.5 183.2,75.9 185.4,78.8 187.6,81.2 189.8,83.2 192.0,85.0 194.2,86.6 196.4,87.9 198.6,89.2 200.8,90.3 203.0,91.2 205.2,92.1 207.4,93.0 209.6,93.7 211.8,94.4 214.0,95.0 216.2,95.6 218.4,96.1 220.6,96.6 222.8,97.1 225.0,97.5 227.2,97.9 229.4,98.3 231.6,98.6 233.8,99.0 236.0,99.3 238.2,99.6 240.4,99.9 242.6,100.1 244.8,100.4 247.0,100.6 249.2,100.9 251.4,101.1 253.6,101.3 255.8,101.5 258.0,101.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"212.0\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">II</text><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"402\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"302\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"302\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"296\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"402\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text><line x1=\"306\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"396\" y2=\"65\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"352.0\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">III</text><line x1=\"442\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"542\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"442\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"442\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">F</text><text x=\"542\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">x</text><line x1=\"446\" y1=\"32\" x2=\"536\" y2=\"106\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"492.0\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">IV</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p><b>Buna göre a, b ve c durumlarında dengeleyici kuvvetin x'e göre değişimi hangi grafiklerle gösterilebilir?</b></p>",
