" y2=\"257\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"238\" y=\"76\" width=\"24\" height=\"174\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#fde68a\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"238\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"126\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"126\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"238\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"126\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"168\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"238\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"168\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"210\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"238\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"262\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"262\" y1=\"210\" x2=\"238\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#92400e\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><polygon points=\"250,74 240,90 260,90\" fill=\"#64748b\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"65\" width=\"428\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#facc15\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"220\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"160\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"160\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"130\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"130\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"70\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"280\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"310\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"310\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"370\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"370\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"400\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"400\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><line x1=\"430\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"430\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"460\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"460\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><line x1=\"490\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"490\" y2=\"81\" stroke=\"#854d0e\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"168\" y=\"90\" width=\"44\" height=\"34\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#9ca3af\" stroke=\"#374151\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#111827\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">60 N</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Karşı ağırlık</text><rect x=\"326\" y=\"75\" width=\"28\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#60a5fa\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"333\" cy=\"87\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"347\" cy=\"87\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"340\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"140\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#1e3a8a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"340.0\" y=\"158.56\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#111827\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">40 N</text><text x=\"374\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e40af\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Araba</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\">Kule</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Destek</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Buna göre,</p><p>I. Araba kuleden uzaklaştıkça karşı ağırlık da kuleden uzaklaştırılmalıdır.<br>II. Araba sağ koldaki 6. çentiğe getirildiğinde karşı ağırlık sol koldaki 4. çentikte olmalıdır.<br>III. Arabaya 40 N yerine 90 N'luk yük asılırsa araba, kol dengede kalacak şekilde sağ kolun ucuna (8. çentik) kadar götürülebilir.</p><p><b>yargılarından hangileri doğrudur?</b></p>",
