   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir boyacı platformu, ağırlığı ve sürtünmesi önemsiz makaralarla kurulmuş iki düzeneğe asılıdır. Platform ağırlığı önemsiz ve eşit bölmelidir; sol ucu soldaki düzeneğin, sağ ucu sağdaki düzeneğin hareketli makarasına bağlıdır. Platformun üzerinde şekildeki yerde <b>120 N</b>'luk bir boya kovası vardır. İki işçi iplerin uçlarını aşağı çekerek platformu yatay dengede tutmaktadır.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 262\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"İki palangaya asılı boyacı platformu\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\">\n<rect x=\"20\" y=\"15\" width=\"500\" height=\"7\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"/><g transform=\"translate(200,0) scale(-1,1)\"><polyline points=\"60,22 60,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 60 140 A 13 13 0 0 0 86 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"86,58 86,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 86 58 A 13 13 0 0 1 112 58\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"112,58 112,250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><line x1=\"112\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"112.0\" y2=\"247.0\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"112.0,256.0 107.0,247.0 117.0,247.0\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><line x1=\"99\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"99\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"99\" cy=\"58\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"99\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><circle cx=\"73\" cy=\"140\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"73\" cy=\"140\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><rect x=\"54\" y=\"157\" width=\"38\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#475569\"/><line x1=\"73\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"73\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><polyline points=\"360,22 360,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 360 140 A 13 13 0 0 0 386 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"386,58 386,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 386 58 A 13 13 0 0 1 412 58\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"412,58 412,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 412 140 A 13 13 0 0 0 438 140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"438,58 438,140\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><path d=\"M 438 58 A 13 13 0 0 1 464 58\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><polyline points=\"464,58 464,250\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7c2d12\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><line x1=\"464\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"464.0\" y2=\"247.0\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"464.0,256.0 459.1,247.0 468.9,247.0\" fill=\"#dc2626\"/><line x1=\"399\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"399\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"399\" cy=\"58\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"399\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><line x1=\"451\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"451\" y2=\"58\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><circle cx=\"451\" cy=\"58\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"451\" cy=\"58\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><circle cx=\"373\" cy=\"140\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"373\" cy=\"140\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><circle cx=\"425\" cy=\"140\" r=\"13\" fill=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"425\" cy=\"140\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#334155\"/><rect x=\"354\" y=\"157\" width=\"90\" height=\"5\" fill=\"#475569\"/><line x1=\"373\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"425\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"425\" y2=\"157\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"127.0\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"399.0\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"399.0\" y2=\"195\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"117.0\" y=\"195\" width=\"292.0\" height=\"10\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#d6a565\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"127.0\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"127.0\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"172.33333333333334\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"172.33333333333334\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"217.66666666666669\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"217.66666666666669\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"263.0\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"263.0\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"308.33333333333337\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"308.33333333333337\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"353.6666666666667\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"353.6666666666667\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"399.0\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"399.0\" y2=\"211\" stroke=\"#713f12\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><polygon points=\"284.33333333333337,161 332.33333333333337,161 327.33333333333337,195 289.33333333333337,195\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#991b1b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308.33333333333337\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#111827\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">120 N</text><text x=\"308.33333333333337\" y=\"153\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#334155\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-weight=\"bold\">Boya kovası</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sol işçi</text><text x=\"456\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"bold\">Sağ işçi</text>\n</svg></div>\n<p>Buna göre,</p><p>I. İki işçinin uyguladığı kuvvetlerin büyüklükleri eşittir.<br>II. Platformu yatay kalacak şekilde 50 cm yükseltmek için sağdaki işçi, soldaki işçinin çektiğinin 2 katı uzunlukta ip çekmelidir.<br>III. Kova platformun tam ortasına taşınırsa soldaki işçinin uygulaması gereken kuvvet artar.</p><p><b>yargılarından hangileri doğrudur?</b></p>",
